This product is the Legal Status/XML exchange

PACKAGING STRATEGY
Each package will be split into one or more package-files:
* on application-date
* within application-date on application-country
* within application-country on size 
* sorted on application-number
Each package will come with its own packaging-index, a table of contents:
* enabling to navigate through the exchange and trace information
* specifying which ranges can be found in what package-file

DELIVERY CONTENTS
One package file will contain one instance of <legal-status-documents>
Each instance of <legal-status-documents> will contain one or more occurrences of <legal-status-document>. 
Instances of <legal-status-document> will be sorted in ascending order by application-country, application-number, application-kind.
Each instance of <legal-status-document> represents one application and its legal history. 
Each instance of <legal-status-document> will contain 
* one occurrence of <application-reference>
* one or more occurrences of <publication-reference>
* one or more occurrences of <legal-event>

